    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <actual value="During the last months of the year 2020 we held interviews with more than 60 persons of the Agricultural Department and Irrigation Department of the Governorate of Anbar.  Due to covid-19 these interviews could not be done on location but were held online or with telephone calls. The assesments of these interviews led to 40 selected participants for the training."></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <actual value="Most of the work of this training project have been accomplished. Thre trainings week were held: the first online, the second in Erbil, the third in Ramadi.  All proposed topics on CSA and Irrigation were trained during these weeks. The last training also dealt with Value Chain Analyses, conform the wishes of the participants. A fourth session with field visits is not yet done, but postponed to March 2022. 

40 selected participants are trained and we found that more persons (being management and staff of the Agricultural and Irrigation departments in Anbar) and some invited persons took the availability to atttent the training."></actual>
